   -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Multiple applications based on the same mesa may have the same mesa_*.h files within each sketch.
   A portable application based on more than one mesa will have to build each version separately in
   a sketch, or, manage multiple mesa declarations within the same mesa_*.h controlled by ifdefs.
   The result is that within the ssTEA/ssUI context, the mesa files are locally modified by a user.
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   the configuration of one to N mesas bugbugbug

